{"type": "concept", "subtype": "problem", "title": "父母社交圈小导致孩子成朋友", "content": "有些父母在精英家庭忙碌工作，慢慢变得没有朋友，社交圈很小，最后孩子真的成了朋友，谁都不相信只相信孩子，特别是夫妻关系不好、爸爸缺席的情况。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["社交圈", "孩子成朋友"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-0cfa8120b7c8-c001:a031", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-0cfa8120b7c8", "blocks": ["b00043", "b00044"], "source_kind": "A1"}, {"source_id": "s-0cfa8120b7c8", "blocks": ["b00043", "b00044"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-0cfa8120b7c8-c001:a011", "kind": "causes", "condition": "父母社交圈小且夫妻关系不好时", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-0cfa8120b7c8-c001:a032", "kind": "causes", "condition": "当父母社交圈小导致孩子成朋友时", "reason": "社交圈小导致孩子成朋友，因此需要建立自己的社交团体。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-0cfa8120b7c8-c001:v2-n001", "kind": "association", "condition": "不同原因：source 不懂做父母，target 社交圈小", "reason": "两者都是导致想跟孩子做朋友的原因，但具体原因不同，无直接互补。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}, {"target": "s-0cfa8120b7c8-c001:v2-n002", "kind": "association", "condition": "适用于估计的特定现象", "reason": "Source 为 a031 描述的现象提供了一个未经数据验证的频率估计（40%-45%），两者相关，但 source 不确定，故标记 association。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-0cfa8120b7c8-c001:u0033"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
